Atomic Tanks: controls
======================

From the game's own README (ReadMe-AtomicTanks). The mouse works the
menus and the buying screen too: left click buys, right click sells.

  Space        fire; select or toggle a menu item
  Return       OK on a menu
  Up / Down    shot power; move through menu items; scroll when buying
  Left / Right aim the gun; buy and sell when buying; change menu values
  Tab or Backspace   change weapon
  Esc          leave a menu
  F1           screenshot
  F10          the computer takes your tank for the rest of the round;
               on the buying screen, saves the game
  v / V        volume down / up
  ~ (or #)     show or hide the scoreboard

Settings and saved games go in the drawer's User drawer; screenshots
(screenshot_001.bmp and on) go in the game's drawer.
Put .bmp pictures in User/ for extra backgrounds and .wav files in
User/music/ for music.
